'''Repel''' (Japanese: '''むしよけスプレー''' ''Repellent Spray'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Switch out your opponent's Active Basic Pokémon to the Bench. ''(Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)''
}}

==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Repel}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card can only be used if the opponent's Active Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon.
** {{TCGP|Sabrina}} has an identical effect to the TCG card Repel, but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an Item card.

===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Repel|130}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
* [[Repel]] is an item in the [[Pokémon games]] that prevents wild Pokémon from appearing.

